{"games":[{"id":6576912941,"name":"A core game","desc":"!! An update to the game is in the works. Some content is still raw, and unfinished. !!\n\n⚠️ Game servers may be susceptible to \"migrating\", aka restarting often due to being outdated. Please be aware of that at all times, especially during early releases. This will not usually be in effect though.\n\nBuried deep within an undisclosed mountain range, there's a facility which is (quite literally) just as dumb as it can possibly get. And whoever owns this place? Yeah they seem a little paranoid for a place owned by a lava lamp company.\n\n\"A Core Game\", or ACG, is supposed to be an accurate representation of your average \"core game\" on Roblox. Even though this has changed over the past few years, the game still takes inspiration from a few titles of the same genre.\n\nGroup: https://www.roblox.com/groups/9486047/Solaris-Development-Group#!/about\nTags: core game reactor acg facility simulation meltdown 0.6 sci-fi solaris","path":"/game/6576912941-a-core-game","slug":"6576912941-a-core-game","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/36e5be9b9fd9606e5b98e96e47d68fd0306f6fd53bccdeeefbfa796c8e9b61a2.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-c0e15d5a28096a516d6b13ac5ff736f9/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":11,"visitor":11444419,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-01-21T04:29:42.715Z","creator":{"name":"Solaris Development Group","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":2,"freeCount":2,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":5109826432,"name":" Undertale: The Obby [NEW ENDING]","desc":"Added some details to every main area and reworked Chara fight ending. Also added Spamton Pet, Undying pet and Sans pet. The next update will probably be the final one.\n\nLeaving a like is the best way to support this game. Good luck and thank you for playing!\n\nFaq:\nQ: How do I get Neutral Ending?\nA: Just play through normally.\n\nQ: How do I get True Ending?\nA: You need to hang out with Papyrus, Undyne and Alphys. They are all in their houses, but you can only hang out with them after sparing them in battle. And yes, you will have to RESET at the end of Neutral Ending.\n\nQ: How do I get No Mercy Ending?\nA: Beat True Ending and FIGHT 1 monster per main area. They can only be fought after beating True Ending.\n\nQ: How do I FIGHT Chara?\nA: Beat No Mercy Ending and look for her in the Ruins.\n\nDevs: \nYuriYSC - Creator\nColdjason - Creator","path":"/game/5109826432-undertale-the-obby","slug":"5109826432-undertale-the-obby","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/3b0072a2492dea597e040959189280969bcbe311f0aea6f114e087553b2dde10.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-d901b24e0f2e3017991e8f6084d4e794/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":11,"visitor":1823368,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-01-02T10:08:31.954Z","creator":{"name":"YuriYSC","type":"User"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":6082527099,"name":"✏️ Project Sudoku","desc":"⚠️ [IMPORTANT] This game is not for sale, nor are there any shares or investments circulating. Thank you for your requests.\n\n🧠 Train your brain with randomly generated Sudoku grids!\n\n🛠️ Check out the in-game changelog for updates!\n\n👍 Got a suggestion or found a bug? Use the in-game feedback section to share them!\n\n📋 Current Version: v4.3.0","path":"/game/6082527099-project-sudoku","slug":"6082527099-project-sudoku","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/b29c554711858a822618495b0ab72159040e64e93786768eb986d7252029f082.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-47977e35cb6eaf6e087927fab03bb6e8/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":11,"visitor":6234930,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2024-12-21T14:08:00.109Z","creator":{"name":"GreatPanda3's Group","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":80180415420094,"name":"YNS Life 😈❗  ","desc":"YNS Life ❗ (BETA) \n\ngame where you can have fun! 🎉\n\nyou spawn with 1 free random gun everytime for quick pv